### New Class: `SubpartitionIndexSet`

```java
package org.apache.flink.runtime.io.network.partition;

/**
 * Encapsulates a subpartition index range (start and end index).
 */
public class SubpartitionIndexSet {
    private final int startIndex;
    private final int endIndex;

    public SubpartitionIndexSet(int startIndex, int endIndex) {
        if (startIndex > endIndex) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("Start index must be smaller than or equal to end index.");
        }
        this.startIndex = startIndex;
        this.endIndex = endIndex;
    }

    public int getStartIndex() {
        return startIndex;
    }

    public int getEndIndex() {
        return endIndex;
    }

    public int size() {
        return endIndex - startIndex + 1;
    }

    @Override
    public String toString() {
        return String.format("SubpartitionIndexSet[startIndex=%d, endIndex=%d]", startIndex, endIndex);
    }
}
```

